"Require all MCP security tests to execute" step, gated on
`runner.os == 'Linux'`, inspects `regression-mcp-server`'s own Surefire
reports and fails the build if any test reports `skipped="[1-9]..."` on
Ubuntu specifically. This matches CLAUDE.md's standing instruction ("The
Ubuntu MCP CI job must fail if any MCP security test is skipped, including
